Z||000041||Superfiero||05-18-2001||04:09 PM||||Just put it on a dyno.  That should tell you what your looking for, whether its running too rich or too lean.  It only costs about 60-80 bucks.  Tuning is very crucial.<P>------------------<BR>88 Fiero 4 cylinder V8 kit and block waiting on back porch.<BR>95 Talon Tsi-14.2@96mph||||reg||1
